  "_comment": "Weapons (Session 6). Models: CC0 Quaternius 'Ultimate Gun Pack' (assets/weapons/) for guns; bat, machete and molotov are built in code (build). Prices are in data/economy.json -> prices.weapons. Fields: type = fists | melee | gun | throw. Roadmap 2 S2: projectile = the gun fires a grenade (launcher) instead of bullets; fuse = seconds before a grenade explodes (0 = when it hits something); blastRadius / blastDamage / blastVehicleDamage = the explosion. damage = life points taken per hit (people have data/combat.json -> people.life). range in metres. fireEvery = seconds between shots / swings. auto = keeps firing while the button is held. pellets + spreadDegrees = shotgun spray. startAmmo = bullets that come with a new gun, ammoPack = bullets in one box bought at the weapon shop (price prices.weapons['ammo-<id>']), maxAmmo = most you can carry. length = how long the model is in metres. aimAssistDegrees = on phones the gun locks on to the nearest target inside this cone. vehicleDamage = damage to a vehicle per hit. knockDown = a melee hit that does not kill still knocks people down. noise = metres around a shot where people panic. grips = how a gun sits in the right hand of the real (Medium/High) Shoumik: offset from the right-hand bone in metres, rotation in degrees, scale; lowGrip = the same for the code-built (Low) Shoumik, relative to his right forearm (y points down the arm). Check grips with: node tools/weapon-grip.js --three <three dir> --out shots.",
